<section class="ex-note" id="def">
<h2>1. Definition &amp; Classification（定義與分類）</h2>
<p><strong>Cutaneous pseudolymphoma（PSL）</strong>：一群在臨床和／或組織學上模擬 cutaneous lymphoma 的良性 lymphoproliferative processes；臨床、病理、免疫表現型各異，病因也不同。<span class="ex-ref">p.2108</span></p>
<ul>
<li>Causative factors：spirochetes（<em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> sp.、<em>Treponema pallidum</em>）、viruses（e.g. parapoxviruses）、infestations（e.g. scabies）、insect bites、疫苗或 hyposensitization 抗原注射、foreign bodies（tattoos、metals）、drugs；找不到原因者稱 idiopathic PSL。<span class="ex-ref">p.2108</span></li>
<li>同義詞：pathologist 常用 <strong>atypical lymphoid proliferation</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2108</span></li>
<li>浸潤細胞組成主要由宿主的 genetic 與 immunologic factors 決定，而非致病原本身；同一致病原常可誘發 B-cell PSL 也可誘發 T-cell PSL。<span class="ex-ref">p.2108</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Group（分組）</th><th scope="col">Entities（疾病）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>1. Nodular PSL</td><td>B-cell PSL、T-cell PSL（含 CD30+ T-cell PSL）、mixed PSL、pseudolymphomatous folliculitis。Causes：infections（<em>B. burgdorferi</em>、<em>T. pallidum</em>、α-herpesviruses、parapoxviruses、molluscum contagiosum virus）、drugs（anticonvulsants、vaccines）、arthropod bites、infestations、leeches（<em>Hirudo medicinalis</em>）、lymphomatoid reaction to tattoo and metals</td></tr>
<tr><td>2. Pseudo-MF（histologic simulators of MF）</td><td>Lymphomatoid contact dermatitis、lymphomatoid drug reaction、actinic reticuloid、immunodeficiency-associated cutaneous CD8+ infiltrates、<em>B. burgdorferi</em>–associated T-cell infiltrates、papuloerythroderma Ofuji、clonal dermatitis</td></tr>
<tr><td>3. Other disorders with lymphocyte-rich infiltrates</td><td>Acral persistent angiokeratoma、lymphoplasmacytic plaque、cutaneous plasmacytosis、cutaneous inflammatory pseudotumor、angiolymphoid hyperplasia with eosinophilia、T-cell–rich angiomatoid polypoid PSL、Castleman disease；另列 lymphocytic infiltration of the skin、palpable arciforme migratory erythema、lichen sclerosus、pityriasis lichenoides、vitiligo、pigmented purpuric dermatoses、morphea（inflammatory stage）、lupus tumidus、lupus panniculitis</td></tr>
<tr><td>4. Benign intravascular proliferation of lymphocytes</td><td>Benign intravascular proliferation of lymphoid blasts、benign atypical intravascular CD30+ T-cell proliferation</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
